  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "When using Index controllers it seems that at random the finger tracking control will go into \"Animation\" mode causing the fingers of your avatar to lock in place. This is for avatars that haven't been set up to do this normally.\nI've only confirmed this behaviour on 3.0 avatars thus far.\nI was able to return to normal by forcing all tracking control settings to \"Tracking\" (a feature I have put in my avatar because it is useful at times). Resetting the avatar ought to also work as a workaround.",
